{"seq":3,"slug":"tracking-gap-stale-detect","title":"轨迹缺口与停滞监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-tracking-event-standardization/event-cleanse-normalize/tracking-gap-stale-detect","wordCount":2371,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"轨迹缺口与停滞监控\">轨迹缺口与停滞监控</h1><p>轨迹系统的输出不只是状态，还有「没有状态」这件事本身。一个包裹清关后七天没有任何事件，这个事实和「包裹在运输中」一样是业务信息：客服要知道该不该主动联系客户，风控要知道该不该标记这笔订单，买家端的页面要知道该显示「轨迹更新中」还是「异常」。</p>\n<p>缺口监控的难点不在于检测，而在于<strong>判据</strong>：多久没有事件才算异常？这个门槛对每个运输段都不同，对每对起终点也不同，而且会随季节波动。用一个大一统的阈值（比如「48 小时无更新即告警」），结果是头程海上段天天误报、清关段永远漏报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>缺口监控要区分两种完全不同的现象，它们的判据、处置、下游动作都不一样：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>停滞（stale）</strong>：运单没有到达下一个预期里程碑，且已经超过了该段正常的停留时长。这是「该动没动」。</li>\n<li><strong>断供（gap）</strong>：某个承运商或某条通道整体停止推送，导致成批运单同时失去事件。这是「通道坏了」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两者的区别在于<strong>范围</strong>。停滞是个体现象（一个运单慢），断供是群体现象（一批运单同时静默）。用同一套逻辑处理会两头失败：把停滞当断供会掩盖真实异常，把断供当停滞会产生海量告警淹没值班。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[统一事件流] --&gt; B[维护运单 last_event_at]&#10;  B --&gt; C{now - last_event_at &gt; 阈值?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[正常]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E{同承运商同期静默运单数占比}&#10;  E --&gt;|高于群体阈值| F[判为通道断供]&#10;  E --&gt;|低于群体阈值| G[判为个体停滞]&#10;  F --&gt; H[通道健康告警 + 尝试备用通道]&#10;  G --&gt; I[运单停滞告警 + 分档处置]&#10;  I --&gt; J{超过该段 P99 停留时长?}&#10;  J --&gt;|否| K[信息性提示]&#10;  J --&gt;|是| L[主动介入候选]\">graph TD\n  A[统一事件流] --&gt; B[维护运单 last_event_at]\n  B --&gt; C{now - last_event_at &gt; 阈值?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[正常]\n  C --&gt;|是| E{同承运商同期静默运单数占比}\n  E --&gt;|高于群体阈值| F[判为通道断供]\n  E --&gt;|低于群体阈值| G[判为个体停滞]\n  F --&gt; H[通道健康告警 + 尝试备用通道]\n  G --&gt; I[运单停滞告警 + 分档处置]\n  I --&gt; J{超过该段 P99 停留时长?}\n  J --&gt;|否| K[信息性提示]\n  J --&gt;|是| L[主动介入候选]</pre><h2 id=\"停滞判据的建模\">停滞判据的建模</h2><p>判据的核心是「期望停留时长」。它不是一个常数，而是 <code>(承运商, 运输段, from状态, to状态)</code> 四元组的分布。工程上不需要完整分布，取两个分位数就够用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分位</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>取法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P50</td>\n<td>正常基线，用于展示「预计还需要多久」</td>\n<td>该四元组近 30 天停留时长的中位数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>P95 / P99</td>\n<td>告警门槛，超过即判停滞</td>\n<td>该四元组近 30 天停留时长的 95/99 分位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"门槛必须自适应而非固定\">门槛必须自适应而非固定</h3><p>固定的 48 小时之所以失败，是因为头程海上段的正常停留是数周，而尾程派送段的正常停留是数小时——两者相差两个数量级。用分位数建模自动解决了这个问题，同时还有两个额外收益：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>季节性自适应</strong>：旺季（如大促后）清关段整体变慢，P95 会随窗口滚动上移，告警不会集体爆发。</li>\n<li><strong>承运商级对比</strong>：同一四元组在不同承运商之间的 P95 差异，直接就是服务质量差异的量化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"样本不足时的降级\">样本不足时的降级</h3><p>长尾四元组（罕见承运商 + 罕见航线）可能样本不足，分位数不可信。降级顺序是：先合并运输段的相邻状态（把 <code>in_transit</code> 与 <code>customs</code> 合并成一个宽档），再把承运商降到「承运商类别」（邮政类、快递类、专线类），最后才用全局默认。每一次降级都要记录在这次判据的元数据里，否则「为什么这条运单的门槛是 6 小时」会成为一个查不到答案的问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH windowed AS (&#10;  SELECT carrier_code, leg, from_status, to_status,&#10;         percentile_cont(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY dwell_seconds) AS p50,&#10;         percentile_cont(0.95) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY dwell_seconds) AS p95,&#10;         count(*) AS samples&#10;  FROM shipment_dwell&#10;  WHERE observed_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY carrier_code, leg, from_status, to_status&#10;)&#10;SELECT carrier_code, leg, from_status, to_status, p50, p95, samples,&#10;  CASE WHEN samples &gt;= 200 THEN &#39;carrier_leg_state&#39;&#10;       WHEN samples &gt;= 50  THEN &#39;leg_state&#39;&#10;       ELSE &#39;global_fallback&#39; END AS rule_source&#10;FROM windowed;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> windowed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier_code, leg, from_status, to_status,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dwell_seconds) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p50,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dwell_seconds) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p95,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> samples</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment_dwell</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> observed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier_code, leg, from_status, to_status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier_code, leg, from_status, to_status, p50, p95, samples,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> samples </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'carrier_leg_state'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> samples </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'leg_state'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'global_fallback'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rule_source</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> windowed;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>percentile_cont</code> 是连续分位数，返回按线性插值得到的位置值，适合时长这类连续量；<code>rule_source</code> 这一列让判据的来源显式可见，这是让告警可解释的最小代价。样本门槛（200 / 50）应当按实际数据量调整，原则是让绝大部分运单落在前两档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"断供检测-群体信号\">断供检测：群体信号</h2><p>断供的判据必须在<strong>承运商级</strong>而不是运单级成立。做法是持续统计每个 <code>(承运商, 通道)</code> 在滚动窗口内「有新事件的运单数」与「该承运商当前活跃运单数」的比值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>断供信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事件到达率</td>\n<td>窗口内事件数 / 期望事件数</td>\n<td>率降到基线的 30% 以下</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活跃运单覆盖率</td>\n<td>窗口内有新事件的活跃运单 / 活跃运单总数</td>\n<td>覆盖率骤降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通道最后成功时间</td>\n<td>该通道最近一次成功接收</td>\n<td>超过该通道正常间隔的 5 倍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同通道跨承运商同步性</td>\n<td>同一 Webhook 端点下多家承运商是否同时静默</td>\n<td>同时静默 = 我方端点故障</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是排查方向的分水岭：<strong>如果多家承运商经同一端点同时静默，问题在我方</strong>（端点挂了、证书过期、防火墙规则变更）；只有一家静默，问题在对方。这个判据把「告警后第一件事该查谁」变成了一个查表动作。</p>\n<h3 id=\"断供时的自动降级\">断供时的自动降级</h3><p>检测到断供后，系统应当尝试启用备用通道。这依赖接入层维护的能力矩阵——同一家承运商往往同时具备多条通道，且不同通道覆盖的运输段不同（见 <a href=\"../carrier-ingest-adapter/carrier-adapter-channel\">API/Webhook/EDI/邮件多通道接入</a>）。降级动作要满足：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>临时且可自动恢复</strong>。主通道恢复后要自动切回，而不是等人操作。</li>\n<li><strong>不改变事件语义</strong>。备用通道产出的同一事件必须收敛到同一个 <code>dedupe_key</code>，否则降级期间会产生双份事件（去重键的合成规则见 <a href=\"event-dedup-order-time\">事件去重、排序与时区/时间戳归一</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>留痕</strong>。降级期间的运单要打标记，因为备用通道的新鲜度通常更差，这些运单的停滞判据应当相应放宽。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"停滞的分档处置\">停滞的分档处置</h2><p>个体停滞不是一个二值判断，而是一条分档的处置阶梯。分档的依据是「超过 P95 多少」以及「这个运单的业务价值」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提示</td>\n<td>超过 P50 但未超 P95</td>\n<td>展示层显示「轨迹更新中」，不告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观察</td>\n<td>超过 P95</td>\n<td>记录停滞，纳入聚合指标，不通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>介入</td>\n<td>超过 P99 且业务价值高</td>\n<td>生成客服待办</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升级</td>\n<td>超过 P99 且已成批出现</td>\n<td>转为断供排查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「观察」档的存在很重要：大部分超 P95 的运单会在几小时内自行恢复，逐个告警只会造成告警疲劳。让它们先进聚合指标、按承运商与运输段聚合出「停滞率」，只有当聚合值显著偏离基线时才升级为人工介入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"停滞率才是可运营的指标\">停滞率才是可运营的指标</h3><p>单条运单的停滞几乎无法用于改进，聚合后的停滞率可以：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT carrier_code, leg,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE now() - last_event_at &gt; p95_seconds)::float&#10;         / count(*) AS stale_rate&#10;FROM shipment_live&#10;WHERE status NOT IN (&#39;delivered&#39;, &#39;return_to_sender&#39;, &#39;cancelled&#39;)&#10;GROUP BY carrier_code, leg&#10;ORDER BY stale_rate DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier_code, leg,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_event_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p95_seconds)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stale_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment_live</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'delivered'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'return_to_sender'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cancelled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier_code, leg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stale_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>按 <code>(承运商, 运输段)</code> 分组的停滞率是一张可直接用于谈判的表：某家承运商的清关段停滞率是同类均值的 3 倍，这是一个有据可查的服务质量事实。它同时也是接入质量监控的输入之一（见 <a href=\"../unified-event-distribute/carrier-event-quality-monitor\">承运商接入质量与覆盖率监控</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"告警规则的正确写法\">告警规则的正确写法</h2><p>停滞与断供的告警必须带 <code>for</code> 持续时间，否则一次抓取抖动就会触发告警。Prometheus 的告警规则语义清楚：<code>expr</code> 为真的每个标签集成为一个独立的告警实例，<code>for</code> 指定条件必须持续为真多久才从 pending 变为 firing（<a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/alerting_rules/\">Prometheus alerting rules</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"groups:&#10;  - name: carrier-tracking-gap&#10;    rules:&#10;      - alert: CarrierChannelSilent&#10;        expr: |&#10;          time() - max by (carrier_code, channel) (carrier_channel_last_success_seconds)&#10;            &gt; 5 * carrier_channel_expected_interval_seconds&#10;        for: 15m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: page&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;通道静默: {{ $labels.carrier_code }}/{{ $labels.channel }}&#39;&#10;&#10;      - alert: CarrierLegStaleRateHigh&#10;        expr: |&#10;          carrier_stale_rate &gt; 2 * on (carrier_code, leg) group_left&#10;            carrier_stale_rate_baseline&#10;        for: 1h&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: ticket\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">carrier-tracking-gap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CarrierChannelSilent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          time() - max by (carrier_code, channel) (carrier_channel_last_success_seconds)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            > 5 * carrier_channel_expected_interval_seconds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">15m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">page</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'通道静默: {{ $labels.carrier_code }}/{{ $labels.channel }}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CarrierLegStaleRateHigh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          carrier_stale_rate > 2 * on (carrier_code, leg) group_left</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            carrier_stale_rate_baseline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ticket</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两条规则的分工是刻意的：通道静默用短 <code>for</code> 加 <code>page</code> 级别，因为它是明确的故障；停滞率偏离用长 <code>for</code> 加工单级别，因为它需要持续偏离才有意义。这个「快故障立即叫、慢漂移攒着看」的区分，是让告警系统保持可用的关键。</p>\n<h3 id=\"keep_firing_for-与数据空洞\"><code>keep_firing_for</code> 与数据空洞</h3><p>Prometheus 还提供 <code>keep_firing_for</code>，让告警在条件不再满足后再保持触发一段时间，用于减少抖动或数据缺失导致的过早恢复（<a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/alerting_rules/\">Prometheus alerting rules</a>）。轨迹场景里它有一个特别贴切的用途：<strong>当监控自身的数据管道出问题时，不要自动解除告警</strong>——静默解除会让「通道恢复」与「监控失明」看起来一样。用 <code>keep_firing_for</code> 保持告警处于触发态，直到数据重新可靠地流动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缺口监控的数据模型\">缺口监控的数据模型</h2><p>支撑上述判据的最小数据模型是两张表：一张记录每次状态跃迁的停留时长（用于生成分位数基线），一张记录运单的实时状态快照（用于在线判定）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE shipment_dwell (&#10;  shipment_id  text        NOT NULL,&#10;  carrier_code text        NOT NULL,&#10;  leg          text        NOT NULL,&#10;  from_status  text        NOT NULL,&#10;  to_status    text        NOT NULL,&#10;  dwell_seconds bigint     NOT NULL,&#10;  observed_at  timestamptz NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX ON shipment_dwell (carrier_code, leg, from_status, to_status, observed_at DESC);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE shipment_live (&#10;  shipment_id   text        PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  carrier_code  text        NOT NULL,&#10;  leg           text        NOT NULL,&#10;  status        text        NOT NULL,&#10;  last_event_at timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  p95_seconds   bigint      NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_source   text        NOT NULL&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shipment_dwell</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shipment_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  carrier_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  leg          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  from_status  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  to_status    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dwell_seconds </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  observed_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment_dwell (carrier_code, leg, from_status, to_status, observed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> shipment_live</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shipment_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  carrier_code  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  leg           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  last_event_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  p95_seconds   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_source   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>shipment_live</code> 里内联 <code>p95_seconds</code> 与 <code>rule_source</code>，是为了让在线判定成为一次单表查询而不是一次 join 加一次分位数计算——判定会在每次事件处理后对每个活跃运单执行，成本敏感。这带来一个副作用：基线更新时要批量刷新 <code>shipment_live</code>，这属于典型的定期重算任务，用批处理而非在线计算换取判定路径的简单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>停滞是个体现象、断供是群体现象，两者判据与处置完全不同，必须分开。</li>\n<li>停滞判据以 <code>(承运商, 运输段, from, to)</code> 的 P50/P95/P99 分位数为门槛，自适应季节与承运商差异；样本不足时按序降级并记录 <code>rule_source</code>。</li>\n<li>断供检测看承运商级的事件到达率与活跃运单覆盖率；多家承运商经同一端点同时静默说明问题在我方。</li>\n<li>断供时自动切备用通道，但必须保证同一事件收敛到同一 <code>dedupe_key</code>，且标记降级期间以放宽判据。</li>\n<li>停滞分四档处置：提示、观察、介入、升级；观察档的存在是为了避免告警疲劳。</li>\n<li>告警规则用 <code>for</code> 区分快故障（page）与慢漂移（ticket），并用 <code>keep_firing_for</code> 防止监控失明被误判为恢复。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"轨迹缺口与停滞监控","id":"轨迹缺口与停滞监控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"停滞判据的建模","id":"停滞判据的建模"},{"level":3,"text":"门槛必须自适应而非固定","id":"门槛必须自适应而非固定"},{"level":3,"text":"样本不足时的降级","id":"样本不足时的降级"},{"level":2,"text":"断供检测：群体信号","id":"断供检测-群体信号"},{"level":3,"text":"断供时的自动降级","id":"断供时的自动降级"},{"level":2,"text":"停滞的分档处置","id":"停滞的分档处置"},{"level":3,"text":"停滞率才是可运营的指标","id":"停滞率才是可运营的指标"},{"level":2,"text":"告警规则的正确写法","id":"告警规则的正确写法"},{"level":3,"text":"`keep_firing_for` 与数据空洞","id":"keep_firing_for-与数据空洞"},{"level":2,"text":"缺口监控的数据模型","id":"缺口监控的数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"物流里程碑状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-tracking-event-standardization/event-cleanse-normalize/milestone-state-machine"},"next":{"title":"统一事件 schema 与 outbox 外发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-tracking-event-standardization/unified-event-distribute/tracking-event-schema-outbox"}}